            <title>[LU-20885] sanity-flr test_44d: stat: cannot statx '/mnt/lustre/d44d.sanity-flr/f44d.sanity-flr': Resource temporarily unavailable</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20885</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com grep -c /mnt/lustre' ' /proc/mounts
Stopping client trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com /mnt/lustre (opts:)
CMD: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com lsof -t /mnt/lustre
CMD: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com umount  /mnt/lustre 2&amp;gt;&amp;amp;1
Starting client: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com:  -o user_xattr,flock trevis-156vm273@tcp:/lustre /mnt/lustre
CMD: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com mkdir -p /mnt/lustre
CMD: trevis-155vm260.trevis.whamcloud.com mount -t lustre -o user_xattr,flock trevis-156vm273@tcp:/lustre /mnt/lustre
stat: cannot statx '/mnt/lustre/d44d.sanity-flr/f44d.sanity-flr': Resource temporarily unavailable
 ** after mirror split &amp;amp; remount, file size=
/usr/lib64/lustre/tests/sanity-flr.sh: line 2404: ((: 10485760 == : syntax error: operand expected (error token is "== ")
 sanity-flr test_44d: @@@@@@ FAIL: mirror extend should not change size, before: 10485760, after
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It looks like a stat on an FLR file returns EAGAIN right after mount because the no-delay glimpse fails while the OST imports are still connecting. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
